  "2026-07-28T03:16:19.243Z","harness:codex","Start evidence 2026-07-28: reproducing and fixing package-owned --status all parity in the same managed SDK/package contract tranche; canonical extraction lineage is linked with a verifies edge."
  "2026-07-28T04:14:10.642Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: dedupe-audit accepts explicit --status all and treats it identically to an omitted lifecycle filter while retaining all in the result filter metadata. Unit tests cover parsing and end-to-end explicit/omitted parity; a packed installed governance package considered open and closed temporary items under --status all."
